## Root Cause
`services/calc/calc.go` currently reads:

```go
package calc

func Version() int     { return 2 }
func Compatible() bool { return false }
```

The failing assertion in `tests/suite/calc_test.go` is:

```go
func TestBCompatibility(t *testing.T) {
	if calc.Version() != 1 && !calc.Compatible() {
		t.Fatal("version 2 requires compatibility support")
	}
